TORCH601 [*] `torch.cuda.amp.GradScaler` is deprecated; use `torch.amp.GradScaler("cuda", ...)`
 --> TORCH601.py:7:10
  |
6 | # Errors (should trigger TORCH601)
7 | scaler = torch.cuda.amp.GradScaler()
  |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
8 | scaler = torch.cuda.amp.GradScaler(init_scale=2.0**16)
9 | scaler = GradScaler()
  |
help: Replace with `torch.amp.GradScaler("cuda", ...)`
4  | from torch.cuda.amp import GradScaler
5  |
6  | # Errors (should trigger TORCH601)
   - scaler = torch.cuda.amp.GradScaler()
7  + scaler = torch.amp.GradScaler("cuda")
8  | scaler = torch.cuda.amp.GradScaler(init_scale=2.0**16)
9  | scaler = GradScaler()
10 |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

